{"login": "Marosko123", "location": "Bratislava", "commits": [{"sha": "9691ae6a5ffcb868776178c69f183e46879164a9", "message": "Fix CI: sync package-lock.json and remove stale /portfolio reference\n\npackage-lock.json was out of sync with package.json (next 15.3.3 vs 15.5.14),\ncausing npm ci to fail. Also replaced removed /portfolio link in 404 page\nwith /blog to fix the type error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-26T13:38:14Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0d229aceb047d85e536178cfb8e6f9150864ca04", "message": "Update version and remove projects", "created_at": "2026-03-26T13:18:09Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "136fb8b97ee1752ddde04b6e3031d75ce726e592", "message": "Broken navbar and added new blog articles.", "created_at": "2026-02-20T10:37:20Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25d504691a326bc92cc0721b05b63aff35333b17", "message": "Fix IC DPH and DIC and copy buttons", "created_at": "2026-02-03T20:43:12Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c3647052459a657536563edd4966115e8714d424", "message": "\ud83d\udc9a", "created_at": "2026-01-15T12:39:48Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d24900ce9604113e4096b666b5e536296ef75c97", "message": "\ud83d\udc1bFixed square icons on landing page", "created_at": "2026-01-15T12:31:14Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cf57a9796c64d7167a63bc3c5dc464e82b42bdb8", "message": "\u2728 Better colours on landing page", "created_at": "2026-01-14T15:08:33Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ade97e305923da5b439f6a42d6e89b77bd7cdd5", "message": "\u2728 Invisible navbar", "created_at": "2026-01-14T13:07:46Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dbc693c08074a57e9edfdad88476721ad49c08e5", "message": "Fixed scroll effect", "created_at": "2026-01-10T09:46:46Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "140b63a629b99b26fec8567bb23e592fb410b351", "message": "\ud83d\udea8 lint problem", "created_at": "2026-01-09T21:14:13Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "61211cc7963deece1b7b22675eb4c60327a17d85", "message": "\u2728Fixed scroll overlay hidden main page", "created_at": "2026-01-09T20:58:57Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2a6642ae8dce51ab8733aaae8eaa02f9ee931068", "message": "Add explicit AI crawler permissions for ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Perplexity", "created_at": "2026-01-08T07:26:10Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0e85ab3c0a839d94f0944940dd45a2dbfb1d7b33", "message": "\ud83d\udc1b fix lottiefiles", "created_at": "2026-01-07T10:45:23Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "374ac22e8aa5e6e3aa3f060805147b784389c9f3", "message": "Scroll fix and hidden main page", "created_at": "2026-01-07T10:24:09Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f3732368191b3a99c78054ea66df3a106698b9f0", "message": "\u2728 Scroll fixes", "created_at": "2026-01-07T09:37:56Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "44a66356789ef3ec76c49a1e0a996044a7fda7d2", "message": "fix(react): robust lottie import to prevent hydration error #306", "created_at": "2026-01-06T23:34:36Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "82688a2ffccd354d22bcf568a3db5eb95a804e6b", "message": "fix: hydration-safe hooks for useIsMobile and useCarousel\n\n- useIsMobile: track hydration state and return false during SSR\n- useCarousel: use desktopItems as default instead of hardcoded 3\n\nThese changes prevent React error #306 by ensuring server and client\nrender the same initial HTML for window-dependent values.", "created_at": "2026-01-06T22:46:40Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9b96091ef287ac3438c8763871962eecdedfe251", "message": "fix: embed critical CSS as string constant for standalone builds\n\nThe InlineCriticalCSS component was using readFileSync to read critical.css\nat runtime, which fails in Next.js standalone builds since source files\nare not included. This caused 500 errors and React #306 crashes on production.\n\nChanged to embed the minified CSS directly as a string constant, ensuring\nit works in all deployment modes.", "created_at": "2026-01-06T22:37:00Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "efa8b66d371491269ab6ae99e45e52a75821feed", "message": "fix(react): resolve React error #306 by extracting default export from lottie-react\n\nThe dynamic import for lottie-react needs explicit .then(mod => mod.default) to properly\nresolve the ESM module's default export, preventing the 'lazy element type must resolve\nto a class or function' error that occurred after scrolling.", "created_at": "2026-01-06T21:55:58Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39076d06b4ad88e54ef41c9a8c9414d6cfa6874b", "message": "fix(docker): include critical.css in production build\n\nThe InlineCriticalCSS component reads critical.css at runtime using\nreadFileSync, but the file was not being copied to the production stage.\n\nThis fixes the 500 error: ENOENT: no such file or directory, open '/app/src/app/critical.css'", "created_at": "2026-01-06T21:39:52Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b8e9e63b50aae24be632bc10dc8893fcee043da5", "message": "\u2728 Optimisations", "created_at": "2026-01-06T16:53:00Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9c2328d83206533fb84c9396d1cc2a961a3b6f19", "message": "\u2728smoother landing page", "created_at": "2026-01-05T23:37:15Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5d8c005eb76a1773ed166c07488c81e05ae1ff46", "message": "\ud83d\udc1b best practices", "created_at": "2026-01-05T23:23:39Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f7e2549de6b3053926ad164f113c3b70a710727", "message": "fix(ci): use git reset --hard to prevent deployment failures from local changes", "created_at": "2026-01-04T13:28:36Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "caa7c8ba9a6158881f18351997542fafe971894c", "message": "fix(seo): resolve sitemap 400/502 errors and consolidate canonical domain\n\n- Nginx: Separate www.rise.sk and rise.sk server blocks for clean 301 redirects\n- Nginx: Remove redundant security headers (delegated to Next.js middleware)\n- Nginx: Add explicit /robots.txt and /sitemap.xml proxy routes\n- CodeBase: Replace all www.rise.sk with rise.sk for canonical consistency\n- Middleware: Deduplicate CSP header entries\n- Layout: Add explicit OG/Twitter image fallbacks\n- Blog: Add Article schema for rich search results\n- Middleware: Add security headers (HSTS, X-Frame-Options, etc.)", "created_at": "2026-01-04T13:20:57Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c9fe58317e8bf06168dc2f4b17073f57995660d5", "message": "\ud83d\udc9a build fixes", "created_at": "2026-01-04T11:26:21Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5bd92b8d247551bd40c0ceca8829954468f55199", "message": "feat: security hardening and performance optimization\n\n- Hardened CSP: Implemented nonce-based CSP in middleware\n- Security: Added HSTS, COOP, and standard security headers\n- Performance: Lazy loaded heavy animations (FloatingShapes, Lottie)\n- Performance: Reverted Hero lazy-load to fix LCP\n- DX: Disabled compression and Trusted Types in dev mode to fix logs\n- Fix: Resolved Analytics CSP violations by injecting nonces", "created_at": "2026-01-04T11:13:06Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bcaf983c4c8c2b3fb9d0b5b4f5954d66d3a2c308", "message": "perf: drastically optimize landing page animations\n\n- GlobalBackground: Remove animate-pulse-slow from mesh gradients (scale animations expensive)\n- GlobalBackground: Remove animate-rotate-very-slow from 200% conic gradient (extremely expensive)\n- GlobalBackground: Static glows instead of animated, reduced blur values (120px\u219280px)\n- FloatingShapesCanvas: Reduce FPS from 30 to 24\n- FloatingShapesCanvas: Remove gradient fills, use solid colors\n- FloatingShapesCanvas: Remove glow/shadow effects (shadowBlur is expensive)\n- FloatingShapesCanvas: Cap device pixel ratio at 2x\n- AnimationProvider: Use useRef instead of useState to prevent re-renders\n- useFloatingShapes: Reduce shape counts (7\u21925 initial, 50\u219225 max)", "created_at": "2026-01-03T19:41:18Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5167f491a8c02fd5f752bb28ec844f04707be8ab", "message": "Security & Performance improvements for Hetzner + Cloudflare\n\n- Remove Vercel references from CSP (vercel.live, vercel-scripts, etc.)\n- Remove unsafe-eval from CSP\n- Add rate limiting to /api/vitals endpoint\n- Add metric name validation\n- Simplify /api/health (remove sensitive info)\n- Add Lottie animation caching\n- Add visibility-based pausing for animations (saves CPU)\n- Add Cloudflare real IP configuration\n- Add SSL setup script for Hetzner\n- Update middleware comments for Hetzner/Cloudflare", "created_at": "2026-01-03T19:22:31Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25aab7557a2261405fba4f6d7f54cd6c4967abd3", "message": "chore: remove vercel.json - migrated to Hetzner", "created_at": "2026-01-03T18:48:58Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e2120a82d27cc630d412d38c831ed13f623dd0c9", "message": "fix: add missing FAQ items 8-11 to both SK and EN translations\n\n- Added 4 new FAQ questions for both locales:\n  - Consulting services\n  - Communication during projects\n  - Maintenance of existing applications\n  - Working with startups/smaller projects\n- Both SK and EN now have complete 12 FAQ items (0-11)", "created_at": "2026-01-03T18:43:25Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e366d48068cd2b3d0a9187f4ac89c1ad1fc35ac4", "message": "fix: revert LoadingScreen to custom hook (renders outside NextIntlClientProvider)\n\n- LoadingScreen is rendered outside NextIntlClientProvider in layout.tsx\n- Reverted to custom useTranslations hook that works without provider context\n- Removed accidentally committed cloudflare configuration files", "created_at": "2026-01-03T18:39:44Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "23b189c8fd3ac4bcdb213bf2246af8cb962605b2", "message": "feat: full internationalization audit and fix\n\n- Synchronized servicesEnhanced, common, and contact namespaces in sk.json and en.json\n- Migrated components from custom useTranslations hook to next-intl hook for correct URL-based locale detection\n- Fixed hardcoded Slovak strings in FAQ, Services, About, Hiring, and Navigation components\n- Internationalized LoadingScreen and legal pages\n- Fixed lint errors in middleware.ts to unblock build", "created_at": "2026-01-03T18:37:53Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f722e072ff36dc4652c31bbefd7886ef84f3c299", "message": "fix: remove vercel analytics and speed insights", "created_at": "2026-01-03T17:46:08Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "91136a26c6d3055ba0fb5b7dbbbb47268971a1b6", "message": "fix: nginx config syntax errors and healthcheck using docker exec", "created_at": "2026-01-03T17:30:42Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "431f3d7d37775df78bdf636642c236ff123582ea", "message": "fix: relax rate limits for static assets and add healthcheck retries", "created_at": "2026-01-03T17:21:13Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "77ee150f46639e5a6da8061bd6aff2bc07312510", "message": "fix: inject public env vars into docker build", "created_at": "2026-01-03T17:13:36Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ed0500229b8f5329e29dc9abee4aa67edbe0982", "message": "fix: use 127.0.0.1 in healthcheck to avoid ipv6 issues", "created_at": "2026-01-03T17:12:25Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3cb925cec571458066eca1465b6e4fe211031b95", "message": "fix: use ghcr.io image in docker-compose and increase healthcheck start_period", "created_at": "2026-01-03T17:11:54Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eccfa355088dbb9e97fd9808fe97b7b354f7e314", "message": "fix: mount host letsencrypt paths in docker-compose", "created_at": "2026-01-03T17:09:46Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7e7a172e4bff7c1899663b03fb4d280fcd6d38f0", "message": "fix: remove unused contact api and update deploy workflow", "created_at": "2026-01-03T17:09:19Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f3248ada99082676067b518721b088270cab756a", "message": "feat: Add Docker deployment configuration for Hetzner\n\n- Add multi-stage Dockerfile for optimized builds\n- Add docker-compose.yml with Nginx reverse proxy\n- Add GitHub Actions workflow for automated deployment\n- Add server setup scripts\n- Add Nginx configuration with SSL support\n- Enable standalone output in Next.js config\n- Performance optimizations:\n  - ISR on all pages\n  - WebVitals 10% sampling\n  - Canvas-based floating shapes\n  - Reduced animation intervals\n  - Rate limiting in middleware\n  - Input validation in contact API", "created_at": "2026-01-03T16:35:10Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bfd8774fea97a6803b9c58cb5792ee63c4e45b97", "message": "\ud83d\udd25 Removed problematic project", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:00:04Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5fdb7ce092f0f735929882ad0b3033347ab9c169", "message": "\ud83d\udc1b interactive logo", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:22:43Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "65afb28d226d376bf5c01fa5341143598a1fd5bb", "message": "\u2728 Nice landing page, carousels, sitemap and SEO", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:07:19Z", "repo": "rise.sk-website", "file_sampled": 